        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 6695, Belmont Dummy Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe design of this Weslock made handleset features square mounts. It is simple yet the classic beauty of the Belmont Dummy Handleset makes it a good choice for those who want to add a touch of quiet embellishment to their doors. Available in satin nickel and oil rubbed bronze finishes. A dummy handleset, the Weslock made Belmont dummy Handleset is just for looks; it neither latches nor locks. Dummy handlesets are most often used as a pull or on the inactive side of double doors to match the existing trim. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset does not function--neither locking nor latching.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <a href=\"/products/woodward-ii-single-cylinder-weslock-handleset-weslock-6691-6200\"><b> Belmont Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis modern styled handleset is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-elegance-collection\"><b>Weslock Elegance Collection</b></a> which features lifetime finish and mechanical warranties.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Belmont Dummy Entranceset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited 10 Year Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Weslock Elegance Collection Belmont Dummy Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Length: 10-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
